---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Characters
seoTitle: "GTA 6 Characters: Jason, Lucia and the Confirmed Cast"
description: "The GTA 6 characters Rockstar has introduced so far: playable leads Jason Duval and Lucia Caminos, and the supporting cast. Spoiler-free."
updated: 2026-11-17
---
<header class="mast" style="--glow:var(--pink)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">The cast</p>
    <h1>Jason and Lucia</h1>
    <p class="tagline">You play two leads, Jason Duval and Lucia Caminos. These are the characters Rockstar has introduced ahead of launch. Open any of them for a full profile.</p>
    <div class="chips"><span class="chip ok dot">Confirmed by Rockstar</span><span class="chip plain">Spoiler-free</span></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cards two">
      {%- for c in cast %}{% if c.lead %}
      <div class="card lead has-img {{ c.lead }}"><img class="card-img" data-zoom="cast" src="{{ c.img }}" alt="{{ c.name }} in an official GTA 6 screenshot" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy"><div class="card-body"><h3><a href="/characters/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ c.name }}</a></h3><span class="role">{{ c.role }}</span><p>{{ c.text }}</p><a class="more" href="/characters/{{ c.slug }}/">Full profile →</a></div></div>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <h2 class="sec-h sm" style="margin-top:34px">Supporting cast</h2>
    <div class="cards three">
      {%- for c in cast %}{% if not c.lead %}
      <div class="card has-img"><img class="card-img" data-zoom="cast" src="{{ c.img }}" alt="{{ c.name }} in an official GTA 6 screenshot" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy"><div class="card-body"><h3><a href="/characters/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ c.name }}</a></h3><span class="role">{{ c.role }}</span><p>{{ c.text }}</p><a class="more" href="/characters/{{ c.slug }}/">Full profile →</a></div></div>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="fig-credit">Screenshots: Rockstar Games</p>
    <h2 class="sec-h sm" style="margin-top:40px">Official artwork</h2>
    <p class="lede">Rockstar's illustrated key art for the cast. Tap to see it full size.</p>
    <div class="gallery big">
      {%- for a in [["jl-01","Jason and Lucia"],["jl-beach","Jason and Lucia at the beach"],["jl-rooftop","Jason and Lucia on a rooftop"],["jl-lock-and-load","Jason and Lucia, Lock and Load"],["jl-robbery","Jason and Lucia, Robbery"],["jl-02","Jason and Lucia on the dock"],["jl-motel","Jason and Lucia at the motel"],["cal-hampton","Cal Hampton"],["boobie-ike","Boobie Ike"],["drequan-priest","Dre'Quan Priest"],["real-dimez","Real Dimez"],["raul-bautista","Raul Bautista"],["brian-heder","Brian Heder"]] %}
      <figure><img data-zoom="art" src="/assets/img/art/{{ a[0] }}.webp" data-full="/assets/img/full/art-{{ a[0] }}.webp" alt="{{ a[1] }}, official GTA 6 artwork" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy"><figcaption>{{ a[1] }}</figcaption></figure>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="fig-credit">Artwork: Rockstar Games</p>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:22px">After launch, anything about what happens to these characters goes behind a spoiler block.</p>
  </div>
</section>
